    practice_set: 1,
    question_text: "The random variables \\(X\\) and \\(Y\\) are independent, with \\(X\\) normally distributed with mean 50 and standard deviation 3, and \\(Y\\) normally distributed with mean 48 and standard deviation 4. \\(\\Pr(X > Y)\\), correct to four decimal places, is",
