    correct_index: 3,
    explanation: "\\(\\Delta E = 13.6\\left(\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{16}\\right) = 2.55\\) eV and \\(\\lambda = \\frac{hc}{\\Delta E} = \\frac{1.242 \\times 10^{-6}}{2.55} = 4.87 \\times 10^{-7}\\) m. 435 nm is the \\(n = 5 \\to 2\\) line; 122 nm is \\(n = 2 \\to 1\\).",
    curriculum_code: 'VCE-PHY-U4-AOS1',
